# Table of materials for DEGAS-2

$Id: 8df77bbc382a65e188046f5c9a29725c8df590c6 $

# Materials are at this point prescribed by labels only. Each material entry
# consists of two lines. The first provides the full name of the material;
# this will be used for labeling output, etc. Spaces are allowed in the name.
# The second line contains the corresponding symbol. To allow complete 
# flexibility, the user is free to choose this symbol; note that no spaces
# are allowed here.

carbon
C

iron
Fe

rough graphite (Ruzic 1993)
C_Ru

mirror
mirror

molybdenum
mo

# This is intended to be generic at the moment.  May need to be more
# specific, e.g., solid vs. liquid, pure vs. saturated vs. dirty
lithium
Li

lithium hydroxide
LiOH

titanium carbide
TiC

yttria
Y2O3






